{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you read, paint, or work, slip into the paws of a striped orange cat.<br>He dreams of sailing above the fabled rainbow to catch a legendary fish.<br>His first voyage goes wrong, but a loving Grandpa Cat teaches him to fish and travel.<br>Be patient: fish to earn, upgrade your gear, and improve your boat.<br>Even while idling, you'll voyage and meet companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather supplies \u2014 and the occasional piece of sea-trash.<br>Build a great ship to call home for you and your crew.<br>Fish every ocean, and witness distant shores and changing climates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And one day... you will reach the Rainbow Above...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs on your desktop, accompanying study, reading, and work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle-focused: earn rewards while AFK.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy, healing atmosphere\u2014relax and unwind.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ocean sailing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic seawater simulation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drifting debris.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backpack and fishing gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests and shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All-new illustrated compendium.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich fishing mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Landmark system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handbook/guide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work Mode (desktop-friendly background play).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/39040